<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>04 / 套路层面</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>六步循环：组织一个套路内部的学习与巩固</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>1 方法识别</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生做什么：从题设、目标和条件判断应使用的套路。需要观察什么：能否解释适用依据，是否混淆相近套路。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>2 母题学习</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生做什么：学习典型解法及其关键步骤。需要观察什么：是否理解各步任务、前置知识和组合顺序。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>3 分步仿练</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生做什么：沿参考步骤尝试完成，发现局部卡点。需要观察什么：哪一步需要帮助，错误对应什么作答证据。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>4 无提示重做</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生做什么：不查看解析、不接受提示条件下完成。需要观察什么：能否独立完成，并与记忆熟悉区分。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>5 同方法变式迁移</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生做什么：在条件或设问变化的新题中使用同类方法。需要观察什么：是否真正识别结构，能否应对合理变式。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>6 延迟复查</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学生做什么：间隔后再次独立完成相应训练。需要观察什么：能力是否保持，是否重新出现原有错误。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：套路层面设计思路.md §3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 39 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>